<!--
id: T09
name: API key created
layout: base
kind: transactional
sender: hi
category: security
topic: none
trigger: api_key_created
phase: 1
subject: A new API key was created
preheader: If this wasn't you, delete the key now.
footer_reason: You're receiving this security notice because an API key was created on your Hydrilla account.
optional: false
data: key_name, created_on
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>A new API key named "{{ trigger.key_name | default: "Untitled" | escape }}" was created on your account on {{ trigger.created_on | default: "today" }}.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If this was you, there is nothing to do. If it wasn't, delete the key now and write to us at <a href="mailto:hi@hydrilla.ai">hi@hydrilla.ai</a>.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/api-keys">Manage API keys</mj-button>
